            "type_base": "Night Walk",
            "type_local": "夜间散步",
            "note_base": "Wander the stone-paved lanes of the UNESCO World Heritage Old Town at night — lanterns glow, water channels babble, and the mood is intimate and romantic",
            "note_local": "石板路、流水声、灯笼光，丽江古城夜晚最有感觉的散步",
            "notes_base": "Start at Four Square Street (四方街) and explore the surrounding lanes. Evening is much quieter than daytime — perfect for a romantic stroll. The area around Xinyi Street (新义街) and Five-One Street (五一街) has the best atmosphere. No entrance fee for the Old Town itself (though there is a maintenance fee if entering some areas).",
            "notes_local": "从四方街出发，沿新义街、五一街漫步。夜晚人少，石灯小桥格外有韵味，适合情侣慢慢逛。古城本身免费进入（部分区域收维护费）。",
