            "note_local": "二楼民谣酒吧，现场驻唱民谣，可免费点歌，气氛温馨文艺",
            "notes_base": "One of Lijiang's most beloved folk music bars, dedicated to Chinese indie folk (民谣). Live performances nightly, singers cover artists like Zhao Lei (赵雷) and Song Dongye (宋冬野). Free song requests. Cost covers drinks (around 60 CNY per person). Perfect for an INFJ evening — warm lighting, acoustic music, intimate setting. Opens from approximately 20:00.",
            "notes_local": "丽江口碑最好的民谣酒吧之一，每晚现场驻唱，演唱赵雷、宋冬野等民谣，可免费点歌。人均消费约60元（含饮品）。温暖灯光、木质装修，适合情侣静静听歌。约20:00开始营业。",
